{"Categories":[9],"HiddenTopics":[],"Topics":[4],"Id":148,"TextResource":{"Name":"modulo-de-informacion-nuevo-pudahuel","Translations":[{"Text":"M\u00f3dulo de informaci\u00f3n NP","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"M\u00f3dulo de informaci\u00f3n NP","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":16},{"FloorId":"3","Id":28},{"FloorId":"1","Id":220}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Porque nuestra misi\u00f3n es hacer que su estad\u00eda en el terminal sea placentera y entregar soluciones ante cada una de las dudas o problemas que pueda tener en su visita, en los mesones de informaci\u00f3n siempre encontrar\u00e1 a alguien dispuesto a brindarle ayuda en cualquier momento del d\u00eda.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Because our mission is to make your experience at the terminal enjoyable and solve any doubts or problems you may have during your visit, our information desk staff are always ready to help you at any hour of the day.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1489712604","Updated":"1489712604","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/148_modulo-de-informacion-nuevo-pudahuel.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/passangers-information\/m%C3%B3dulo-de-informaci%C3%B3n-np","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/informaciones-al-pasajero\/m%C3%B3dulo-de-informaci%C3%B3n-np","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/148_modulo-de-informacion-nuevo-pudahuel.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/148\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/148_modulo-de-informacion-nuevo-pudahuel.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/148\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]